<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for attending the Columbus Commitment: <em>Advancing Pay Equity in Our Community </em>discussion hosted by <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/womenscommission/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">The Columbus Women’s Commission</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We encourage you to join our movement in 2022: <strong><em>100 Adopters. 100 Days. 100% Committed</em></strong> and <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/WorkArea/DownloadAsset.aspx?id=2147499944&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">sign the Columbus Commitment Pledge</a>!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Columbus Commitment is a voluntary, employer-led pledge to close the wage gap and achieve pay equity for working women. As of March 2022, <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/payequity/adopters/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">over 287 local employers</a> have signed the pledge and are examining their practices to address equity.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong><br>Learn More about the Columbus Commitment Pledge<br></strong>To learn more about the Columbus Commitment: Achieving Pay Equity pledge <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/WorkArea/DownloadAsset.aspx?id=2147499651&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">click here</a> to download the <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/WorkArea/DownloadAsset.aspx?id=2147499651&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Columbus Commitment Packet</a> which outlines the benefits of joining the learning community and answers commonly asked questions. You can also learn more by visiting the Columbus Commitment webpage at <a href="http://www.columbus.gov/payequity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">www.columbus.gov/payequity</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">When you sign the pledge you will be joining local employers committed to sharing best practices for building equitable and inclusive workplaces.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Ready to Sign the Pledge?<br></strong><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/WorkArea/DownloadAsset.aspx?id=2147499944&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Click here</a> to download the Pledge.<br><a href="https://survey123.arcgis.com/share/afb32929b1ce44299084e4b006fb5f04?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Click here</a> to upload your signed Pledge.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Have Questions?<br></strong>We are excited to partner with your organization. To schedule a meeting to discuss signing the Columbus Commitment, please email Christina Ratleff at <a href="mailto:CLRatleff@columbus.gov" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CLRatleff@columbus.gov</a> or visit the Columbus Commitment webpage at <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/payequity/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">www.columbus.gov/payequity</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Meeting Materials</strong><br>We encourage you to share the webinar recording with others in your network, and invite additional company leaders to sign the Columbus Commitment Pay Equity Pledge.</p>
